生伴中重度下尿路症状的疗效与安全性。目标人群为50-85岁男性患者，以IPSS总评分≥13分且QoL≥3分界定中重度下尿路症状，并以前列腺体积30-80mL进一步限定疾病状态。研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计，以治疗第52周IPSS总评分较基线的变化作为主要疗效评价指标，治疗期与主要疗效评价时点均为52周，用于支持在持续治疗条件下评价症状改善。研究将通过R3A-BPH101与安慰剂组的比较，确证其治疗良性前列腺增生相关下尿路症状的疗效与安全性。","rationale":"本节正文依据已确认的确证性研究定位、目标人群（50-85岁、IPSS≥13分且QoL≥3分、前列腺体积30-80mL）、口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂给药途径、随机双盲安慰剂对照多中心设计及第52周IPSS主要疗效指标形成。药物作用机制、非临床与既往临床证据、流行病学与治疗现状来源待补充，医学作者需核对人群与终点表述并完善论证。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_b56039e3cf24443d","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:141b009da1e103db88f796df","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b77374359659b7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929205944_aec3bc55","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_dcedb3760172c9fc:full-draft:141b009da1e103db88f796df","quote":"章节编号=3\n章节标题=研究目的和终点\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"a8b9b45afe91b92e213d526d19ae3afa39ee8105510ae9a58af984bb2251b951","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:141b009da1e103db88f796df","span_id":"sp_sel_3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"9910bf06ee75c8853c143b11ec7df385f95306b1d5f76e729515dd9609db0a9c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"sp_sd_purpose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心III期确证性研究","quote_sha256":"b54023d287ba13